(8635,'enUS','The battles of ages past are seeds from which legends grow. Yours is a time of heroes, young one. May your legend take root, thrive.$B$BI bid you well, $n, and offer you this token...',0),
(8636,'enUS','The stuff of life is doomed to die and return to the earth, but the stuff of spirit lives eternal. I bid you well, $n, and offer you this token...',0),
