(11788,'enUS','Wow, you survived!$B$BI guess all that\'s left to do now is to deal with Gearmaster Mechazod.',0),
(11789,'enUS','I thank you, $n. This man\'s recovery will be slow, but we won\'t lose him.$B$BWhat do you say? You found cultists inside the Stormbreaker? You\'d best notify someone... and bring some evidence.',0),
(11790,'enUS','Cultists? Below deck? I ought to have my whole crew flogged!$B$BListen... why don\'t we have Admiral Cantlebree take care of this... situation?',0),
(11791,'enUS','Thank you for your concern, $n. We were made aware of the situation not too long ago.$B$BCounselor Talbot assures me that this was an isolated incident and not a cause for military concern.$B$BOur civilian authorities will make sure everyone involved is properly prosecuted.',0),
(11792,'enUS','Be discreet, $n. We cannot look at this evidence in front of prying eyes.',0),
(11793,'enUS','Speak quickly, $C. What information do you have on the cult?',0),
(11794,'enUS','You\'ve done well, $n. However, I can\'t shake the feeling that this is not the last we\'ve seen of these death cultists.$B$BDarkness has a way of hiding even in plain sight.',0),
(11795,'enUS','Thank you once again, $n. With your help, I may yet be able to complete this mission, disastrous as it\'s been, and return to Fizzcrank to make my report and properly honor the dead.',0),
(11796,'enUS','Once again, you have my thanks, $n. Without you, I would not have been able to recover anything useful from this disaster.',0),
(11797,'enUS','Nice job, $n. Show the lads how it\'s done. The only good creeper\'s a dead creeper!',0),
(11798,'enUS','<The old gnome breathes a heavy sigh of relief.>$B$BIt is done then... you have saved us! If you hadn\'t stopped him here, then who knows how far his madness would have spread?$B$BWith the threats from the blue dragons and the Nexus War, not to mention the Lich King, the last thing we need is a mad creation of the Titans running loose!$B$BThank you, $n!',0),
(11799,'enUS','Desecrate the Horde\'s Netherstorm bonfire!',0),
(11800,'enUS','Desecrate the Horde\'s Silithus bonfire!',0),
(11801,'enUS','Desecrate the Horde\'s Stranglethorn Vale bonfire!',0),
