(12371,'enUS','Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),
(12372,'enUS','Incredible! Let me just say that I continue to be amazed by what you younger races seem capable of.$B$BWe are indebted to you. Will you come back and help us again tomorrow?',0),
