(24776,'enUS','Anotha newblood, eh?$B$BYa actually have a wild look about ya though. Fierce eyes. You might have the makings of a real $C.$B$BLets not waste anymore time \'den.',0),
(24777,'enUS','Not bad, mon. Ya have a natural flow to ya attacks - you may have a talent for dis.$B$BSome rough edges ta be sure, but we\'ll get dose ironed out here and I\'ll teach ya a few new tings as we go.',0),
