(28779,'enUS','I thank you, $n. Even after I had escaped, I did not imagine I\'d be able to return home.',0),
(28780,'enUS','It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life!',0),
(28780,'frFR','C’est vrai, on nous a tendu une embuscade. Je n’ose plus envoyer de soldats là-bas et risquer de les perdre aussi. Il me faut un volontaire qui serait prêt à risquer sa vie !',0),
(28781,'enUS','Excellent work, $n. Your reputation is well-deserved.',0),
(28782,'enUS','Hell-Hoot is slain, and her meat is just as succulent as you\'d expect.$B$BToday, we eat a legend. Thank you, $n.',0),
(28783,'enUS','It is true, then? The great blight upon our race will soon end now that the Neferset have lost the ability to corrupt any more of our people.$B$BName your reward, $C. It is the least we can do for you.',0),
(28784,'enUS','It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life!',0),
