(37012,'enUS','Hunted the hunter, eh? Your beast doesn\'t seem any worse for wear, either! I\'ll brush it down.',0),
(37013,'enUS','You know, I didn\'t really believe you when you decided to start training this thing. But here it is, a trained riverwallow.$B$BI guess if a beast needs training, you\'re the one to do it! Great work, commander!',0),
(37014,'enUS','You can hear the power building inside the unit.',0),
(37015,'enUS','Those poor beasts! I\'m glad you two put that ogre out of commission. Check back in tomorrow and we can continue the training.',0),
(37016,'enUS','From now on, I\'m sure your mount will always remember to keep one eye on the skies. Great job!',0),
