(37020,'enUS','Hunted the hunter, eh? Your beast doesn\'t seem any worse for wear, either! I\'ll brush it down.',0),
(37021,'enUS','A fine beast, to be sure, commander. It\'ll stand up in even the toughest battles.$B$BI\'ll admit, I\'m a bit jealous of ye\'! Here\'s the reins! I\'ll be sure to take good care of it when ye bring it back.',0),
(37022,'enUS','Those poor beasts! I\'m glad you two put that ogre out of commission. Check back in tomorrow and we can continue the training.',0),
