(37025,'enUS','Well, it\'s a bit wet, but seems to be in good spirits. I\'ll get \'er dried off and into bed.',0),
(37026,'enUS','The sand worm\'s bit the dust? Well done, I\'ll get this beast bedded down for the night.',0),
(37027,'enUS','Hunted the hunter, eh? Your beast doesn\'t seem any worse for wear, either! I\'ll brush it down.',0),
(37028,'enUS','I can\'t believe you\'ve managed to train your wolf already! It feels like it was just yesterday that the little ball of fur and death came into my stables.$B$BI\'ll hand it to ye, that\'s a fierce little mount ye got there. Here\'s the reins, enjoy!',0),
(37029,'enUS','You have done it!$B$B<Goraluk takes the items from your hands, and turns his back for a few moments>$B$BNow, I will touch this Sigil to your hand, and the entrance to the Crucible will open at your touch. Good luck.',0),
(37030,'enUS','You have done it!$B$B<Goraluk takes the items from your hands, and turns his back for a few moments>$B$BNow, I will touch this Sigil to your hand, and the entrance to the Crucible will open at your touch. Good luck.',0),
